"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6640a359",
"en_raw": "I should have asked Tomoki"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "69a82891",
"en_raw": "from the start"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "fbb09597",
"en_raw": "Call him / Hold off. Is Tomoki in...?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "1c1c9aa8",
"en_raw": "Is this Tomoki?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "6762c71e",
"en_raw": "...Oh, Sango-chan?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "b8d0feb2",
"en_raw": "It's been a while"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "ae34e582",
"en_raw": "Aww, I wanted to hear your voice~"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "29de41bb",
"en_raw": "Phones are banned at my house now"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f0a12f84",
"en_raw": "and I was dying"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "8fc6db08",
"en_raw": "Ha ha, too many long calls?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "35ecb12f",
"en_raw": "So you're calling from outside now?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "db6fea3b",
"en_raw": "So I can't talk"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e980df74",
"en_raw": "for very long"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "a3cc5b29",
"en_raw": "...Waaah"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "99ce32b8",
"en_raw": "Don't cry, don't cry"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "5600f0ed",
"en_raw": "...So, what happened?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "13b20744",
"en_raw": "This may sound like a weird question"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "68986687",
"en_raw": "Tomoki"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "fac36f35",
"en_raw": "...do you know why babies"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "22a8d94c",
"en_raw": "in the womb dance?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d2c54fa4",
"en_raw": "Babies in the womb?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "168c45f7",
"en_raw": "...Why they dance?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "27e34163",
"en_raw": "Yeah, if I can't figure that out..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4bb14f90",
"en_raw": "supposedly a child with no face"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "40dd98c7",
"en_raw": "will be born"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "24c0a954",
"en_raw": "...Can that happen?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "6b8fff7a",
"en_raw": "Medically speaking"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "281d762d",
"en_raw": "there's no way"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "9c37ef74",
"en_raw": "It's just a rumor"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "2f03fc57",
"en_raw": "Just a rumor, huh..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2688dd29",
"en_raw": "But Sango-chan, you should be"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "77cf849f",
"en_raw": "careful with that kind of story"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "2a9a30bf",
"en_raw": "They call it 'casting a curse'"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "10b16a12",
"en_raw": "making someone anxious with obscure words"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "452c4076",
"en_raw": "even if it doesn't have the exact effect"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "356ca1fa",
"en_raw": "dealing psychological damage"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a8eae654",
"en_raw": "to the other person"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "c3990466",
"en_raw": "is a curse that's been common since ancient times"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "9f8609bf",
"en_raw": "Oh, Tomoki, come on"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "33c673e8",
"en_raw": "Remember I told you about kotodama before?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "5ba26710",
"en_raw": "It's the same thing"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "52b753a1",
"en_raw": "You'd better clear it up"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "21bdc9e1",
"en_raw": "because the answer isn't in the dictionary"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "9940a652",
"en_raw": "Now that you say it, true..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "9873ea9f",
"en_raw": "So, Sango-chan"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "14763069",
"en_raw": "did you figure anything out?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "58aab7a3",
"en_raw": "Something's nagging me"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "8304e843",
"en_raw": "but I can't remember"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "65e1ec54",
"en_raw": "So I called Tomoki..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "f4030e8f",
"en_raw": "Hmm~"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "8c84d180",
"en_raw": "I've already figured it out"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "9c6b5613",
"en_raw": "Huh?!"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "905df1e6",
"en_raw": "I think Sango-chan"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "db74e03b",
"en_raw": "probably knows it too"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "811bbdab",
"en_raw": "...I know it?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "78492889",
"en_raw": "I remember / Don't know... but fine"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ceb9fb95",
"en_raw": "I'm not getting married"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "8adfead8",
"en_raw": "and I won't have kids either"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "793bc4ad",
"en_raw": "I've heard that before"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "a4c2a704",
"en_raw": "but it's separate from this time"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "05af4882",
"en_raw": "Dancing babies... why?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "6c9b0bc5",
"en_raw": "Hmm, what was it"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "6fab755e",
"en_raw": "Um, the keywords are..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "6ce301bb",
"en_raw": "Right, right"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "838a8f05",
"en_raw": "Dream / Reality and then..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "c6596877",
"en_raw": "Field / Mountain and then..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "75ac1d95",
"en_raw": "Kyu / Tsune, and... -saku!"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "5b319904",
"en_raw": "That's it, these words"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "d302b85e",
"en_raw": "are the opening of Dogra Magra"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "e0f7648e",
"en_raw": "Fetus, fetus, why do you dance"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "9f984a38",
